<title>JAPAN: Indonesia raises Dec Minas to $23.11--traders.</title>
<headline>Indonesia raises Dec Minas to $23.11--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for December lifting was calculated at $23.11 per barrel, up 51 cents from November, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p>    TYPE		   DEC	     NOV</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  23.13	   22.73</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	23.02	   22.64</p>
<p> Attaka		   23.94	   23.58</p>
<p> Cinta		    22.37	   21.87</p>
<p> Duri		     21.56	   21.07</p>
<p> Handil		   22.84	   22.34</p>
<p> Lalang		   22.98	   22.54</p>
<p> Widuri		   22.30	   21.80</p>
<p> Belida		   23.88	   23.57</p>
<p> Anoa		     24.34	   23.98</p>
<p> Badak		    23.94	   23.58</p>
<p> Bekapai		  23.94	   23.58</p>
<p> Bunyu		    22.81	   22.30</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     22.10	   21.59</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    22.82	   22.44</p>
<p> Walio		    22.91	   22.40</p>
</text>
